{"displayStem":"같은 항원으로 첫 접종과 56일째 추가 접종을 시행한 한 대상자의 추적 자료이다. 접종 사이의 감염은 확인되지 않았고 같은 검사법으로 측정하였다. 상대단위에는 보호역가 기준이 설정되어 있지 않다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>항원 특이 IgG</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"항원 특이 IgG。첫 접종 후 시간 (day)、항체 (상대단위)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">항체 (상대단위)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">17.5</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">35</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">52.5</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">70</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">125</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">250</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">375</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">500</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"></line><text x=\"90\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\">첫 접종</text><line x1=\"428\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"428\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"></line><text x=\"428\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">추가 접종</text><polyline points=\"76,228.304 101.14285714285714,227.956 120,226.216 138.85714285714286,221.344 164,207.772 208,200.11599999999999 296,214.036 384,220.3 428,222.388 446.85714285714283,185.152 472,83.536 516,99.54400000000001\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"228.304\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"101.14285714285714\" cy=\"227.956\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"226.216\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"138.85714285714286\" cy=\"221.344\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"207.772\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"208\" cy=\"200.11599999999999\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"214.036\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"384\" cy=\"220.3\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"222.388\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"446.85714285714283\" cy=\"185.152\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"472\" cy=\"83.536\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"99.54400000000001\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">대상자</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">첫 접종 후 시간 (day)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div clas